messages:   35%|###4      | 208/600 [10:37<01:54,  3.41it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nDirect selling refers to the business mode in which direct selling enterprises recruit sellers to sell products directly to final consumers outside the fixed business place.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is direct selling?\n# Options:\nA) After selecting salesmen, a dairy manufacturer set up 100 sales points in the city to sell dairy products at a unified price.\nB) A bookstore adopts online sales. after customers place an order, the courier will send the products to the designated place and charge a fee.\nC) Some salesmen recruited by a cosmetics brand set up stalls along the road to distribute product descriptions and sell them to customers at lower prices.\nD) At the beginning of school, the new student xiao he bought five table lamps in the wholesale market, one for his own use, and the other four were sold to his classmates.', "<think>.\nTo determine which option is an example of direct selling, let's analyze each option step by step:.\n\nA) After selecting salesmen, a dairy manufacturer set up 100 sales points in the city to sell dairy products at a unified price.\n- This option describes a scenario where the dairy manufacturer sets up sales points (which can be considered as a fixed business place) to sell dairy products directly to final consumers.This is not a direct selling approach because the salesmen are working within a fixed business structure rather than selling directly to consumers outside of it.\n\nB) A bookstore adopts online sales.After customers place an order, the courier will send the products to the designated place and charge a fee.\n- This option describes an online sales model where customers place orders online and the bookstore sends the products to the customer's location.This is not a direct selling approach because the bookstore is not selling directly to the customer; instead, it is facilitating the transaction through an online platform.\n\nC) Some salesmen recruited by a cosmetics brand set up stalls along the road to distribute product descriptions and sell them to customers at lower prices.In this scenario, the student xiao he purchased five table lamps at the wholesale market and sold one for his own use, while the remaining four were sold to his classmates. This aligns with the concept of direct selling because the student is directly selling products to his classmates, who are not the final consumers in the direct selling context.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
