ce microbes.However, the context only mentions the potential threat to humans, not the environment itself.\n   - **Option B**: "Human space activities may lead to the spread of space microbes to earth.".\nBased on the analysis, the most appropriate interpretation of the article is that space mutant fungi will not be a threat to mankind.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
