his claim.\n2.The health consequences and associated costs of not rejecting the rejected cheese: The lawmaker argues that the health consequences and associated costs of not rejecting the rejected cheese are negligible, but we need to know the exact cost of these consequences to evaluate this claim.\nNot considering the impact of the cheese importation board's actions on cheese exporters: The lawmaker argues that the possibility of having merchandise rejected by the cheese importation board encourages many cheese exporters to ship substandard cheese to Goronia, but we don't need to know the extent to which this encouragement occurs to evaluate this claim.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
