messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe term boundary problem refers to various short-sighted behaviors of employees due to the short employment relationship in modern enterprises, and the harm caused by such behaviors to the enterprise\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings belongs to the term boundary problem\n# Options:\nA) Because he will retire in one year, lao zhao feels unable and his work efficiency is getting worse and worse\nB) Because he was not familiar with the business, xiao li, who had just come a month, lost a big customer and the company lost a lot\nC) Because he felt that it was impossible to become a regular worker,xiao wang worked hard every day to show himself \nD) Because he only signed a contract for half a year, xiao sun ignored the use of working machinery and equipment', "<think>.\nTo determine which option belongs to the term boundary problem, let's analyze each option step by step:.\n\nA) Lao Zhao feels unable due to his short-term employment and his work efficiency is getting worse.This could be a boundary problem because he is not fully committed to his job due to the short-term nature of his employment.\n\nB) Xiao Li lost a big customer and the company lost a lot because he was not familiar with the business.This could also be a boundary problem because his lack of familiarity with the business could be due to the short-term nature of his employment.\nXiao Sun paid close attention to working machinery and equipment because he only signed a contract for half a year. This could be a sign of his dedication to his job, which might be influenced by the short-term nature of his employment.\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
