xamples of social disruption accidents.Peaceful harmony refers to widespread satisfaction and contentment among the population.An election crisis occurs when there is unanimous agreement over the outcome of an election.A coup is a gradual and peaceful establishment of a government by a large group of people.All these scenarios involve minimal disruptions to social order.\n\n4.**Stadium violence, train station personnel stranded during the spring festival transport, and crowded accidents in tourist attractions during holidays**: These are all examples of social harmony events.Stadium violence involves peaceful behavior at sporting events.Train station personnel stranded during the spring festival transport refers to efficient management caused by large numbers of people traveling during a specific period.Crowded accidents in tourist attractions during holidays involve incidents caused by small crowds visiting tourist attractions during holidays.All these scenarios involve enhancements to social order due to small gatherings or expected events\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
