ings were rescued within two hours of the building's collapse.\n- This option provides information about the effectiveness of emergency teams in rescuing people trapped in collapsed buildings.However, it does not directly relate to the device's ability to detect weak, ultralow-frequency signals associated with a beating heart.Therefore, this option is not the best choice.\n\nD) The device is unable to give a distinctive reading when the signals it detects come from human beings rather than from any other living beings.\n- This option implies that the device lacks the ability to differentiate between human beings and other living beings based on the signals it detects.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
