eated after it has cooled.\nThe plant manager believes that implementing the new process will be expensive but ultimately beneficial for the company.\nThe supervisor supports the general consensus but has a different opinion on a specific aspect mentioned by the plant manager about the new copper-smelting process.\n\nLet's consider the choices:\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
