ple of prioritizing financial gains over social responsibility. It demonstrates a commitment to profit-making over improving society through financial contributions.\n\n4.**Option D**: "An organization refuses to hire disabled individuals in violation of the law on the protection of the disabled."This option involves disregarding laws that protect the rights of the disabled, which is a legal violation rather than a proactive social response.While it is a negative action, it is specifically aimed at discriminating against a marginalized group rather than addressing a social issue or benefitting society in a broader sense\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
