ersity and Qian Hong was admitted by Tsinghua University.\n   - Classmate C guessed: Zhao Ming was admitted to Peking University and Sun Jie was admitted to Tsinghua University.\n   - The students' guesses were half right.The guesses made by Classmate C were mostly correct, as Zhao Ming, Qian Hong, and Sun Jie were all admitted to their respective universities.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
