ment does not fit the context.\n\nC) The welfare system has become a heavy burden on the governments of some European countries.\nThe pursuit of fairness will not affect social development to any extent.It only describes the benefits and drawbacks of the welfare system.Therefore, this statement fits the context.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
