2001 and this year, the planning department budget did increase.\n- This option provides evidence that the planning department's budget increased in some years, which could suggest that the budget increase in this year is justified. If this is true, it would weaken the claim made in the letter regarding the justification of the editorial's conclusion.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
