 has been re-accepted.\n   - D) It is assumed that it has been truly accepted without giving a reasonable explanation.Option C suggests that the mistaken belief that the bicycle reappeared in 1860 shows that it has been re-accepted.This is necessarily true; the re-appearance of bicycles in 1860 could be due to various reasons, not just acceptance of the technology. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
