itize service quality over other features.Therefore, this option directly challenges the company\'s belief about the air conditioner\'s superiority.\n\n3.**Option C**: "The service life of this air conditioner is lower than the average of similar products.".The option that best supports the judgment of the company\'s management is: "Power consumption is not the main concern of most consumers when choosing air conditioners.".. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
