 tools are not used for engraving.Therefore, this option does not logically follow.\n\n**Option B: No etching tool is both pin-tipped and bladed.**\n- This option is not directly related to the conclusion about the number of tools used for engraving.It simply states a condition about the tools themselves, which does not affect the comparison between tools used for engraving and those not used for engraving.Therefore, this option does not logically follow.Not all tools used for engraving are etching tools.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
