n\nB) Professor Zhang has never bought a house.He believes that buying a house is not as good as renting a house, and renting a house is not as good as borrowing a house.The statement accurately captures Professor Zhang's financial situation rather than his personal preference, making it a perfect match for the characteristics of the sandwich layer.\n\nD) Xiao Li, Xiao Wang, and Xiao Liu who have just been recruited by the company live in a luxurious apartment provided by the company.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
