vide any information about the future usage of the airport.Therefore, we cannot conclude that the number of owners using the airport will not change appreciably in the future.\n\nThe airport's operating expenses were not greater than the revenue raised from sources other than the airport user fees for private planes.\n- Contrary to the previous option, this statement indicates that the airport's operating expenses were not higher than the revenue generated from other sources, including user fees for private planes. This contrasts with the given information, suggesting that the revenue from user fees was sufficient to cover the operating expenses.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
